{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会in大阪(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方ありがとうございました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではいつものくだり。私服クイズですちゃーらん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.春。春ですよ。ひめたんの大好きなピンクを着なくて何を着るんだよこのやろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.春。春ですよ。あえてベージュでお姉さんぶってこその春じゃないかこのやろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちでしょう(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめきゅんさんならわかるよね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの趣味とか好きなものとか知ってるでしょ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「1ーっ!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「2ーっ!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って叫んだ方から正解をみてくださいこちらっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/2494976/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかちょっとお姉さんぽくなった??ていろんな方に言われましたけれども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうかしらー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはベージュパワーじゃないでしょうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま高校だもんね。16歳だもんね。どやー('・ω・`)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいそしてー大阪。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりミニ握以来って方が多かったかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからひめたんの地元広島から近いので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがスクール通ってた時から応援してくださっていた方なんかも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊びにきてくださりまーした∪・ω・∪☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらに話かわって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は全国握手会でございますよみなさんんぬっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんご(松村沙友理chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅみゅ(若月佑美chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん(宮澤成良chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第６レーンでお待ちしてます(^ω^)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらにパフォーマンスもあるね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握３回目にして初の33人全員参加ー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい前回中元さんも欠席したひとりなんだけどねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうね。楽しみすぎるね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい最後にもいっこ宣伝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでストリーミングラジオ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは乃木坂46公式サイトで聴けると思うんじゃけどねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単に説明しますと、メンバーたちのフリートークが聴けますよって話(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの組み合わせ・登場順はじゃんけんで決め、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほとんど白紙に近いような原稿を渡され"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも15分程度もお話しするて!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも4/28から公開のそのラジオ、撮ったの4/26だからね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊急企画すぎるよね(^ω^)わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう。ひめたんは4/28、第一回のオンエアのやつに登場!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅみゅ(若月佑美chan)まあや(和田まあやchan)ひめたんの３人です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったらきいてみーてねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張ります!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}